	(text "LJ12A3-4-Z/BX inductive sensor, NPN normally open: in front of a bolt its output goes to ground.\nThe sensor sinks the current of the EL817 LED, which is fed from +12V_P through R401;\nR402 pulls the output up for fast edges."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 20.828 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
